* Fri Feb 27 2026 Weilin Tong <tongweilin@linux.alibaba.com> [6.6.102-5.3_rc1%%DIST%%]
- tls: make sure to abort the stream if headers are bogus (Jakub Kicinski) {CVE-2025-39946}
- tls: handle data disappearing from under the TLS ULP (Jakub Kicinski)
- net: bridge: fix use-after-free due to MST port state bypass (Nikolay Aleksandrov) {CVE-2025-40297}
- af_unix: Initialise scc_index in unix_add_edge(). (Kuniyuki Iwashima) {CVE-2025-40214}
- tls: fix handling of zero-length records on the rx_list (Jakub Kicinski) {CVE-2025-39682}
- netfilter: nf_tables: reject duplicate device on updates (Pablo Neira Ayuso) {CVE-2025-38678}
- ipvs: Defer ip_vs_ftp unregister during netns cleanup (Slavin Liu) {CVE-2025-40018}
- crypto: essiv - Check ssize for decryption and in-place encryption (Herbert Xu) {CVE-2025-40019}
- bridge: mcast: Fix use-after-free during router port configuration (Ido Schimmel) {CVE-2025-38248}
- crypto: af_alg - Disallow concurrent writes in af_alg_sendmsg (Herbert Xu) {CVE-2025-39964}
- xfrm: delete x->tunnel as we delete x (Sabrina Dubroca)
- sched/fair: Ratelimit update to tg->load_avg (Aaron Lu)
- anolis: sched: Add cmdline control for SCHED_MM_CID feature (Yinan Liu)
- anolis: kernel-spec: default arm64_64k rpms build to disabled (Qinyun Tan)

